            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Area Klik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Area: a part of the game that, clicked while the mouse is free, does its actions (back to combat when you close the inventory)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Area Klik: bagian game yang, jika diklik saat mouse bebas, menjalankan aksinya (kembali ke pertempuran saat kamu menutup inventaris)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a button of the game, then press its key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik tombol di game, lalu tekan tombolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a button or stick to place its control, or drag it to where it goes on the game (onto a control to bind it). With a control selected, press a button on the controller or click it here to bind it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik tombol atau stick untuk menaruh kontrolnya, atau seret ke tempatnya di game (ke sebuah kontrol untuk mengikatnya). Saat sebuah kontrol dipilih, tekan tombol di controller atau klik di sini untuk mengikatnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click area" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Area klik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click it, then press the key for this direction" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik, lalu tekan tombol untuk arah ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click it, then press the key to hold for running (Shift, for example)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik, lalu tekan tombol yang ditahan untuk lari (misalnya Shift)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click one to add it, or drag it onto the game’s button. A tap is quickest: click the game’s button, then press its key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik untuk menambahkannya, atau seret ke tombol game. Ketuk paling cepat: klik tombol game, lalu tekan tombolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to add it, or drag it onto the game’s button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik untuk menambahkannya, atau seret ke tombol game."
          }
        }
      }
