    "Click to add it: it shows in the list of controls, not on the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik untuk menambahkannya: ia muncul di daftar kontrol, bukan di game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicked while the mouse is free, the area does these in order. Switch Mode changes to another set of controls; Free and Lock the Mouse change what the mouse does with the eye." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
