      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every button and stick comes off its controls, and the sticks go back to their standard settings. Saved presets stay, and Cancel in the editor still undoes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua tombol dan stik dilepas dari kontrolnya, dan stik kembali ke pengaturan standar. Preset tersimpan tetap ada, dan Batal di editor masih bisa mengurungkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every button and stick comes off its controls, the sticks go back to their standard settings, and the controls only the controller worked are removed (%lld). Saved presets stay, and Cancel in the editor still undoes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Semua tombol dan stik dilepas dari kontrolnya, stik kembali ke pengaturan standar, dan kontrol yang hanya dijalankan kontroler dihapus (%lld). Preset tersimpan tetap ada, dan Batal di editor masih bisa mengurungkannya."
          }
