        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terbalik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is the layout’s only mode: the layout is one set of controls again, and they all stay. Cancel in the editor still undoes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ini satu-satunya mode di tata letak: tata letak kembali menjadi satu kumpulan kontrol, dan semuanya tetap ada. Batal di editor masih bisa mengurungkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its controls stay in the other modes. Cancel in the editor still undoes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontrolnya tetap ada di mode lain. Batal di editor masih bisa mengurungkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its manifest is not one this version of Avo reads." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manifest-nya tidak bisa dibaca oleh versi Avo ini."
