        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tata letak saya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs the eye (FPS)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perlu mata (FPS)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never in it: Android’s data and your apps’ files, the keys Avo uses for ADB, your fingerprints and your accounts. Email addresses, account names, tokens and locations are taken out of the logs, and your home folder shows as ~." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tidak pernah disertakan: data Android dan file aplikasi Anda, kunci yang dipakai Avo untuk ADB, sidik jari Anda, dan akun Anda. Alamat email, nama akun, token, dan lokasi dihapus dari log, dan folder rumah Anda ditampilkan sebagai ~."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No controller connected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tidak ada kontroler tersambung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa tombol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No run key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanpa tombol lari"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No screen of this Mac refreshes in step with %lld fps, so motion can judder a little." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tidak ada layar Mac ini yang ber-refresh seirama dengan %lld fps, jadi gerakan bisa sedikit tersendat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Normal" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Normal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nonaktif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: the click also touches the game there (its Close button). Off: it only does the actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyala: klik juga menyentuh game di situ (tombol Tutup-nya). Mati: hanya menjalankan aksinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place for %@:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taruh untuk %@:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placed “%@” for %@. Drag it onto the game’s own button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Placed “%1$@” for %2$@. Drag it onto the game’s own button."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” ditaruh untuk %2$@. Seret ke tombol milik game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Platformer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Platformer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play the macro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jalankan makro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port %lld is already in use by another app. Choose another port." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Port %lld sudah dipakai app lain. Pilih port lain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presets" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Preset"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presets are kept with this game’s key mapping; Done saves them. A name already in use replaces that preset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Preset disimpan bersama pemetaan tombol game ini; Selesai akan menyimpannya. Nama yang sudah dipakai akan menggantikan preset itu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a key for this button (right-click: a mouse button). Click it again to cancel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombol untuk tombol game ini (klik kanan: tombol mouse). Klik lagi untuk membatalkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a key, or right-click for a mouse button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan sebuah tombol, atau klik kanan untuk tombol mouse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press four keys in turn, %@ first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan empat tombol bergantian, mulai dari %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press its key or controller button. Right-click for a mouse button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombolnya atau tombol kontroler. Klik kanan untuk tombol mouse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press its key. Drag ↘ to set how far it reaches." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombolnya. Seret ↘ untuk mengatur jangkauannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the hotkey’s key, then add what it does in the panel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombol untuk hotkey ini, lalu tambahkan apa yang dilakukannya di panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the key that locks and frees the mouse (F8, for example)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombol yang mengunci dan melepaskan mouse (misalnya F8)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the key to hold for running (Shift, for example)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan tombol yang ditahan untuk lari (misalnya Shift)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press to toggle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tekan untuk beralih"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressed, the control does these in order: its own touch first, then each action. Switch Mode changes to another set of controls; Free and Lock the Mouse change what the mouse does with the eye." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saat ditekan, kontrol ini menjalankan semua ini berurutan: sentuhannya sendiri dulu, lalu setiap aksi. Ganti Mode berpindah ke kumpulan kontrol lain; Lepaskan dan Kunci Mouse mengubah apa yang dilakukan mouse dengan mata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressed, the hotkey does these in order and touches nothing. Switch Mode changes to another set of controls; Free and Lock the Mouse change what the mouse does with the eye." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saat ditekan, hotkey ini menjalankan semua ini berurutan tanpa menyentuh apa pun. Ganti Mode berpindah ke kumpulan kontrol lain; Lepaskan dan Kunci Mouse mengubah apa yang dilakukan mouse dengan mata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the area over the game’s button and size it by its edges, then add what a click does in the panel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Letakkan area di atas tombol game dan atur ukurannya lewat tepinya, lalu tambahkan apa yang dilakukan klik di panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puts each control on the button games of that kind use, going by its name and key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menaruh tiap kontrol di tombol yang biasa dipakai game jenis itu, berdasarkan nama dan tombolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "R-Click" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klik-Kanan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RAM must be a multiple of 256 MB." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAM harus kelipatan 256 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RAM must be between 2 and 16 GB." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
